<div class="page">
  <div class="landing-section">
    <div class="header">
      <%= image_tag 'profile_photo.jpg', class: 'profile-photo' %>
      <h1>Welcome to My Portfolio</h1>
    </div>
    <p>Explore my projects and learn more about my journey in tech.</p>
    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down big-arrow" id="reveal-arrow"></i>
  </div>

  <div class="content-section hidden" id="content-section">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>I'm Rachel! I am super passionate about helping others and want to create positive experiences for people through design and technology that solves real-world needs. I started my programming journey with a six month bootcamp at Le Wagon, Tokyo. Outside of improving my development skills, I enjoy running, various types of dance, reading, tending to my houseplants, and of course, lots of coffee.</p>
    
    <h2>Projects </h2>
    <%= image_tag 'freshtracker_logo.png', class: 'freshtracker-logo' %>
    <p>Pantry management and recipe generation web application leveraging AI photo recognition and data analysis.</p>
    <a href="https://www.freshtracker.online/" target="_blank">Go check it out!</a>
    <h3>Strēt</h3>

    <h2>Tech Stack</h2>
    <div class="tech-stack">
      <div class="tech-category">
        <h3>Languages</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Ruby on Rails</li>
          <li>NextJS</li>
          <li>React</li>
          <li>TypeScript</li>
          <li>JavaScript</li>
          <li>HTML + CSS</li>
          <li>Bootstrap</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-category">
        <h3>Datastore</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>SQL</li>
          <li>ActiveRecord</li>
          <li>PostgreSQL</li>
          <li>MySQL</li>
          <li>Supabase</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-category">
        <h3>Tools</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>OpenAI</li>
          <li>Git</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="tech-category">
        <h3>Cloud</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>AWS</li>
          <li>GCP</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // This event listener works with both initial page load and Turbolinks navigation
    $(document).on('turbolinks:load', function() {
      var arrow = document.getElementById('reveal-arrow');
      var content = document.getElementById('content-section');
      
      if (arrow && content) {
        arrow.addEventListener('click', function() {
          content.classList.remove('hidden');
          content.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
        });
      }
    });
    
    // Also handle the initial page load if turbolinks is disabled
    $(document).ready(function() {
      var arrow = document.getElementById('reveal-arrow');
      var content = document.getElementById('content-section');
      
      if (arrow && content) {
        arrow.addEventListener('click', function() {
          content.classList.remove('hidden');
          content.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
        });
      }
    });
  </script>
</div>
